# TrueFace 3D Environment Configuration
# For standalone Vercel demo, leave these empty. The frontend will use the high-performance local spatial engine.
# When your Java 21 Spring Boot backend is deployed (e.g., on Render, Railway, or AWS), specify the URLs below:

# VITE_BACKEND_API_URL=https://your-java-backend.onrender.com/api
# VITE_BACKEND_WS_URL=wss://your-java-backend.onrender.com/ws/spatial-telemetry
